rows.10:3a70:
But when three delinquents had killed themselves one after another, even the school couldn't keep quiet any longer.
Was a war breaking out between delinquents, or was some other problem at work? The police investigation grew more intense as well.
And as a first step, the roof was put off-limits.{p}

rows.10:4154:
He felt as if he had become the king of this world.
He could end the life of any of those wretched humans he could see from this spot, any time he pleased.
The thought struck him as hilarious.{p}

rows.10:4b50:
Even now, everything is still shrouded in mystery.
And that's the end of my story.
Well then, I'll hand things over to the next person.{p}

rows.10:54dc:
"It's Aizawa!
Look, it's Aizawa!"
Arai, who had been gripping the railing beside {f:me|me}, suddenly pointed into the empty air and climbed right over the top of it.{p}

rows.10:5bc8:
Of course.
That's proof that you're normal, {a}{f:.|.}
Everyone has what they call an instinct for self-preservation, it seems...
But there was once someone who felt no fear at all, no matter how frightening the place.{p}
